@host = http://localhost:5069
@tunnel = https://YOUR-TUNNEL.devtunnels.ms
@phone = 92XXXXXXXXXX
@verifyToken = YOUR_VERIFY_TOKEN

### App chal rahi hai ya nahi
GET {{host}}/

### Reminder bhejna
POST {{host}}/send-message?phoneNumber={{phone}}&medicine=Panadol

### Webhook verify (sahi token)
GET {{host}}/webhook?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token={{verifyToken}}&hub.challenge=12345

### Webhook verify (ghalat token)
GET {{host}}/webhook?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token=ghalat&hub.challenge=12345

### Webhook POST (nakli message, tunnel ke zariye)
POST {{tunnel}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "object": "whatsapp_business_account",
  "entry": [{
    "changes": [{
      "field": "messages",
      "value": {
        "messages": [{
          "from": "{{phone}}",
          "type": "text",
          "text": { "body": "le li" }
        }]
      }
    }]
  }]
}